 "description": "<p>Twenty vibration modes is the count on this wand, and the flexible head is what makes the number usable — the neck bends to hold contact at angles a rigid wand cannot reach, so each mode has a geometry to work with rather than a single fixed line.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator black\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblack_1_3f423095-2375-48e7-a40a-d43ba7ebb9b6_480x480.jpg?v=1692863784\"></p>\n<p>Skin-friendly silicone over durable ABS forms the body, the combination that rinses clean and stays that way. The quiet motor keeps discretion through the whole twenty-mode range, and the compact frame hides in a wash kit or drawer without bulk.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator black\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblack_6_7fc46253-7a9c-4638-a303-6a8c4aa105ad_480x480.jpg?v=1692863798\"></p>\n<p>Magnetic USB technology handles charging — the cable finds its contacts on approach, and there is no port cover to lose or misalign. One safety note the listing makes and we repeat: no charging while in use.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator black\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblack_2_8739e9c8-2127-4ae1-8ebe-f30a7255db5c_480x480.jpg?v=1692863789\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vibration modes: 20</li>\n<li>Head: flexible, positionable</li>\n<li>Material: skin-friendly silicone + ABS</li>\n<li>Charging: magnetic USB</li>\n<li>Noise: quiet motor</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator black\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblack_4_928d4d1f-3dfc-4832-8ade-bd2ccff09929_480x480.jpg?v=1692863792\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator black\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblack_5_9a699d65-d1ab-4931-9239-29baefbd811b_480x480.jpg?v=1692863796\"></p>\n<p>Twenty modes on a bending neck — the wand that angles to the user, not the reverse.</p>\n",
